msgid "The transfer window for order #%1$s has ended and the order was cancelled. Do not transfer for it now. If you transferred before the deadline, enter the transaction id from your transfer message on your order page within 72 hours: %2$s. Your order comes back when your transfer matches it, as long as the products are available; otherwise contact the store with your order number."
msgstr "انتهت مهلة التحويل لطلبك #%1$s فأُلغي. لا تحوّل له الآن. إن كنت حوّلت قبل الموعد فاكتب رقم العملية من رسالة التحويل في صفحة طلبك خلال 72 ساعة: %2$s، فيعود طلبك حين يطابقه تحويلك ما دامت المنتجات متاحة؛ وإلا فتواصل مع المتجر برقم الطلب."

#. translators: 1: order number, 2: transaction id.
#: src/Expiry.php:548
#, php-format
msgid "The transfer window for order #%1$s has ended and the order was cancelled. We kept the transaction id %2$s, so do not transfer again. If you transferred before the deadline, your order comes back when your transfer arrives and the store checks it, as long as the products are available; otherwise contact the store with your order number."
