#. translators: %s: order number.
#: src/Expiry.php:551
#, php-format
msgid "The transfer window for order #%s has ended and the order was cancelled. Do not transfer for it now. If you transferred before the deadline, the store brings your order back after it checks your transfer, as long as the products are available; otherwise contact the store with your order number."
